 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id2030028\" class=\"interactive-embedded-reading\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\">Link to Learning</div>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id2004529\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20241024.164013/resources/3d37a494f3a5845f1a1b17df077c61bab951b030\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\">\n</span>\n    <p id=\"fs-id2571418\">Visualize how mRNA splicing happens by watching the process in action in this video.\n\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id1171119155972\" data-alt=\"mRNA_splicing\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"switch\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/16-5-eukaryotic-post-transcriptional-gene-regulation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-media=\"print\">Access multimedia content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/mRNA_splicing\" class=\"os-is-iframe\" data-media=\"screen\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>",
